                <invention-title lang="fr">DISPOSITIF DE TRANSISTOR ET PROCÉDÉ DE FABRICATION</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">TRANSISTOR DEVICE AND METHOD OF MANUFACTURING</invention-title>
